{"speciesId":506,"names":{"fr":"Ponchiot","es":"Lillipup","en":"Lillipup","ja":"ヨーテリー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fait vaillamment face à des ennemis très puissants, mais il est intelligent et évite les combats trop inégaux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It faces strong opponents with great courage. But, when at a disadvantage in a fight, this intelligent Pokémon flees."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les longs poils de son museau font un excellent radar qui analyse les alentours avec une grande acuité."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The long hair around its face provides an amazing radar that lets it sense subtle changes in its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les longs poils de son museau font un excellent radar qui analyse les alentours avec une grande acuité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los mechones que cubren su cara actúan como un magnífico radar para detectar con precisión lo que hay a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The long hair around its face provides an amazing radar that lets it sense subtle changes in its surroundings."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"顔を 覆う 長い 毛は 優れた レーダー。周囲の 様子を 敏感に 察知する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Bien que vaillant, il a aussi l’intelligence d’analyser toutes les situations et de fuir quand il anticipe une défaite."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Aunque se trata de un Pokémon valeroso, también es lo bastante inteligente como para escapar si el rival es muy fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"勇猛な ポケモンだが 相手の 強さを 確かめて 戦いを 避ける 賢さも 併せ持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les longs poils de son museau font un excellent radar qui analyse les alentours avec une grande acuité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los mechones que cubren su cara actúan como un magnífico radar para detectar con precisión lo que hay a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The long hair around its face provides an amazing radar that lets it sense subtle changes in its surroundings."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"顔を 覆う 長い 毛は 優れた レーダー。周囲の 様子を 敏感に 察知する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Bien que vaillant, il a aussi l’intelligence d’analyser toutes les situations et de fuir quand il anticipe une défaite."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aunque se trata de un Pokémon valeroso, también es lo bastante inteligente como para escapar si el rival es muy fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"勇猛な ポケモンだが 相手の 強さを 確かめて 戦いを 避ける 賢さも 併せ持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Très sage, il n’aboie et ne mord pas sans raison, ce qui en fait un Pokémon domestique très apprécié des Dresseurs casaniers."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"No suele ladrar mucho, por lo que resulta muy popular entre los Entrenadores que viven en apartamentos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Because it doesn’t yelp, it’s extremely popular with Trainers who live in apartment buildings."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"キャンキャン 吠えたり しないので マンション暮らしの トレーナーに 人気の 高い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les poils qui masquent son visage lui servent de radar, et lui permettent ainsi d’évaluer la position et la puissance de ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los mechones que le cubren el rostro actúan como un radar con el que averiguan la envergadura de posibles contrincantes."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The long fur surrounding its face functions as radar, enabling it to probe the condition of its battle opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"顔を 覆う 毛は レーダーの 役目を 持っており 戦う 相手の 様子を 探るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Réputé pour sa grande perspicacité, il s’enfuit la queue entre les pattes s’il s’estime trop faible pour gagner."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon destaca por su perspicacia. Si percibe que no lleva las de ganar, no duda en huir con el rabo entre las piernas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon has excellent judgment. If it decides it can’t defeat an opponent, it immediately turns tail and vamooses."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"判断力に 優れた ポケモン。 勝てない 相手と 判断したら さっさと シッポを 巻いて 逃げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa docilité en fait un Pokémon facile à élever. Il est notamment populaire auprès des Dresseurs débutants."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este inteligente Pokémon es muy popular, ya que obedece sin rechistar a su Entrenador e incluso los novatos pueden entrenarlo sin problemas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon is popular with beginners because it’s intelligent, obedient to its Trainer’s commands, and easy to raise."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"賢く トレーナーの いうことを 素直に 聞くので 初心者でも 育てやすいと 人気の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon est courageux, mais prudent. Les poils doux qui recouvrent son visage lui permettent de sonder les alentours."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es valiente pero cauto. Usa el suave pelaje que le recubre el rostro para obtener información sobre su entorno."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is courageous but also cautious. It uses the soft fur covering its face to collect information about its surroundings."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"勇敢 かつ 慎重。 顔を 覆う 柔らかい 毛で まわりの 情報を キャッチ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon est plus intelligent que la plupart des enfants. Il n’oublie ni l’affection qu’il a reçue ni les mauvais traitements qu’il a pu subir."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Muestra una inteligencia muy superior a la media de los niños humanos. No olvida ni el amor ni los malos tratos que recibe."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon is far brighter than the average child, and Lillipup won’t forget the love it receives or any abuse it suffers."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"並みの 子ども よりも ずっと 利口。 受けた 愛情も された 仕打ちも 忘れないのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":506,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"level-up",26],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",26],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",26],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",26],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",26],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",26],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",